 applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="faqs-about-posting-to-dublin" class="faqs" index="7" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>FAQs about posting to Dublin</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How long does it take to send a parcel to Dublin?-open answer" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How long does it take to send a parcel to Dublin?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltodublin-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It takes between 6 and 8 days to send a parcel to Dublin.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatcanisendtoireland-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatcanisendtoireland" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatcanisendtoireland" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What can I send to Ireland?-open answer" data-test-id="whatcanisendtoireland-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatcanisendtoireland-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What can I send to Ireland?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatcanisendtoireland" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatcanisendtoireland" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatcanisendtoireland-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When posting parcels to Dublin or beyond in Ireland, there are some restrictions to be aware of.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can find out which items are not permitted by taking a look at our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/send/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->prohibited items list<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> as well as the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://www.iata.org/en/publications/dgr/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://www.caa.co.uk/passengers/Before-you-fly/Baggage/Banned-items/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->UK Civil Aviation Authority<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> pages.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->These provide the latest guidelines on items that can’t be sent via airlines.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Will I need to deal with customs when sending to Dublin?-open answer" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Will I need to deal with customs when sending to Dublin?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="willineedtodealwithcustomswhensendingtodublin-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient. If you have sold items to France, and taxes and duties apply, you will be given the option to pay the charges on your recipient&#39;s behalf when purchasing your parcel delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is there import tax from the UK to Dublin?-open answer" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is there import tax from the UK to Dublin?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isthereimporttaxfromtheuktodublin-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->UK business or marketplace seller? <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/europe" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->sending parcels to Europe<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to find out more about IOSS.​<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->International standard delivery service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you&#39;re using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyinternationalparcels" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my international parcels?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyinternationalparcels-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my international parcels?</span><!--]--><div class